  message: "Re-validated via apollo-server cohort 2026-05-21 post-WI-misud fix (PR f31de0ee69). framework_role=route symbols 1 -> 11; 'hypergumbo routes' on apollo-server shows 6 routes (was 0) in production source. The WI-tisam pipeline is now complete end-to-end: INV-rolul confirmed 13 kind=call UCs emitted by _extract_http_handler_contexts (PR #3826); WI-misud fixed materialize_route_symbols to scope the (method, path) dedupe key by source symbol id for kind=file sources, so per-file catch-all concepts each produce a route Symbol. Verdict: moved."  # f4d1
